  "description": "It was discovered that CairoSVG fetched external files referenced by SVG\ndocuments by default. If a user or automated system were tricked into\nconverting a specially crafted SVG file, an attacker could possibly use\nthis issue to perform server-side request forgery attacks or cause a denial\nof service. After this update, CairoSVG only fetches external files when\nthe unsafe option is used.",
